&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="過「舒適生活」，兩個年齡組別的二人家庭的每月生活費分別增至33,550港元及33,495港元。" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4073376/19304-exxxxxx-hsbcrm-tc-3-1307x1737_600.jpg" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4070000/4073376/19304-exxxxxx-hsbcrm-tc-3-1307x1737_600.jpg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
